<content>
<procedure>
<preliminaryRqmts>
<reqCondGroup><reqCondDm><reqCond>Stop the rig and disconnect the bench power supply.</reqCond><dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="ARFRIG" systemDiffCode="A" systemCode="00" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="131" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></reqCondDm></reqCondGroup>
